    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:fb5db666cae6efb7",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "06a1c04020a82d4563dc5980ee6ba64a59e56461278c4c822a7e9d6ba7bc1f5e",
      "text": "“City tour by the heights – Charming La Paz”. Start with the street of the embroiderers, where colourful folk costumes are displayed, then the historic centre: the Witches’ Market and its Andean mystical items, the Church of San Francisco, Plaza Murillo with the Executive and Legislative Palaces and the Metropolitan Cathedral, and the Killi Killi viewpoint.\n\nRide the cable car for a beautiful panorama over the city, on one of the longest urban cable car networks in the world, then visit the impressive Valley of the Moon, 10 km from the centre, whose curious formations, shaped by wind and heavy rain, create a lunar landscape. Return to the hotel.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "word_aligned",
        "fileId": "1DlvieRFQtbPhDADN4y0-elcPotlc5xVc",
        "documentSha256": "63afd78b41eb7f5d6604aee9365bbbf4ae0e2c44c841e9ae61acc140bb7e7708",
